    "detailed_description": "Back Rank Chess is a brand new chess variant.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is very easy to learn.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou must protect the back rank against an onslaught of enemy pawns. <br />\r\nThe pawns are controlled by an advanced chess engine that will outsmart you many times!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou win by capturing all the enemy pawns before they reach the back rank. <br />\r\nIf any pawn touches the back rank, you lose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features THREE modes of difficulty - BEGINNER, AMATEUR and EXPERT.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 66 hand-crafted stages, each titled and designed for a unique experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch out - the Expert stages might kick your butt !",
